# Forthcoming features

Last updated 21 October 2026

These are the features we're working on next and approximately when we hope to release them.

This information is just a guide. It's not everything we're doing, and things may move.

We'll update everyone with an account when we release new features.

## What we're working on now

Over the next 3 months we'll be prioritising:

- Allowing people to save their progress and return to a form later using One Login 
- Improvements to our new multiple routing feature, so you can add routes to questions that have more than 10 options 
- Delivering submissions via a webhook so it's easier to integrate with other systems, for example customer management systems 
- Opening early access for local authorities to use GOV.UK Forms – [contact us](https://www.forms.service.gov.uk/support) if you are interested, as places are limited 

## What we're planning next

- Custom validation to limit number of characters, dates and improve how to find addresses 
- Allowing you to customise the branding on your forms, rather than having to request it 
- Opening up use of GOV⁠.⁠UK Forms to local government and non-crown central government 
- Allowing people to answer a group of questions multiple times 
- Exploring integration with GOV⁠.⁠UK App and Agentic AI 

## Further in the future

- Improve how to add users to groups 
- More detailed metrics about a form’s performance and an integrated way to get feedback from people who fill in a form 
- Being able to preview what each question will look like, as you’re adding them to your form 
- Storing previous versions of a form, and being able to revert back to them 
- Opening up use of GOV⁠.⁠UK Forms to the wider public sector 
- Taking payments via API - so you can collect payments part way through the journey through a form 
- Allowing people to fill in forms using information they’ve already provided to government 

## What’s new  

- You can add routes to direct people through your form based on their answers, so they only need to answer the questions that are relevant to them
- We released a private beta version of customisable branding on forms, [contact us](https://www.forms.service.gov.uk/support) if you want to use it 

You can also [read about our current features](https://www.forms.service.gov.uk/about/features). 

## Other features

There are many other features and iterations we know will be useful. We'll update this page when we know when we're likely to work on them.

If you have any feedback about existing features, or need a feature that isn’t listed here, you can [contact us](<%= support_path %>) to let us know.
